description:
Susun empat baris output sesuai perubahan nilai dari atas ke bawah.

```java
public class TraceVariableUpdates {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int value = 4;
        System.out.println(value);
        value += 3;
        System.out.println(value);
        value *= 2;
        System.out.println(value);
        value -= 5;
        System.out.println(value);
    }
}
```
